      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14189986/assets/29729a2b35aa370f46f15d221764b3cf8fd6344ff475016b92a974cfb31b08c2.png)\n\nFor the function $f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+1$ shown above, what is the expression for the area $A$ as a definite integral?\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $A$ | $=$ | $\\int $ | {{field-2}} | $\\text{d}x$ |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |  |",
